[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=NiriCapture Settings
Name[zh_CN]=NiriCapture 设置
Comment=Configure tools, palette, canvas, theme, OCR and paths
Comment[zh_CN]=配置工具栏、调色板、画布、主题、OCR 和保存路径
